#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/quickstart.rst:53
#: 9068d3370cd04790b0d18ff966e74d74
msgid ""
"Normally MAVProxy will auto-detect the correct baudrate. If required, the "
"baud rate can instead be manually specified."
msgstr "通常情况下，MAVProxy 会自动检测正确的波特率。如有需要，也可手动指定波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/quickstart.rst:76
#: 71b21a263e944b5ea4316be92132ee4b
msgid "Over Network"
msgstr "通过网络"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/quickstart.rst:78
#: b1b9b5baee25494b86f46baf45f58b9a
msgid ""
"Specify the IP address and port containing a mavlink stream. The address to "
"connect to must be your own IP address or loopback address. Alternatively, "
"if the local IP address is not known, use 0.0.0.0 for MAVProxy find and use "
"the local IP address. The type of stream (tcp or udp) should also be "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"指定包含 MAVLink 流的 IP 地址和端口。要连接的地址必须是您自己的 IP 地址或回环地址。或者，如果不知道本地 IP 地址，可使用 "
"0.0.0.0 让 MAVProxy 自动查找并使用本地 IP 地址。还应指定流的类型（tcp 或 udp）。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/quickstart.rst:89
#: b4cf2b780d124d64805f4d8e05ae5c98
msgid ""
"If connecting to a remote IP address, the udpout or tcpout arguments should "
"be used:"
msgstr "如果连接到远程 IP 地址，应使用 udpout 或 tcpout 参数："

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/quickstart.rst:99
#: ee2ff66e5baf4322b4739e6998ed9126
msgid ""
"MavProxy can output a mavlink stream to remote network addresses using UDP "
"Broadcast."
msgstr "MAVProxy 可通过 UDP 广播向远程网络地址输出 MAVLink 流。"
